+## 19. Consistency Check & Recalculation Sync Policy
+- **Daily Activity Consistency Check (`dailyActivityConsistencyCheck`)**:
+  - Automatically runs once daily via Cloud Scheduler cron (`0 4 * * *`, 4 AM UTC).
+  - Performs consistency validation for all active users using the Intervals.icu API as the source of truth, auditing activity counts and component distance accumulation.
+- **Manual Component Recalculation ("RUN SYNC" button)**:
+  - Located on `MyBikes.jsx` for master administrators.
+  - Invokes `recalculateAllUsersPartDistances` to recalculate component distance totals across all users based on `initialDistance + sum of checked activity distances`.
+  - Manual consistency check (`runManualConsistencyCheck`) remains available as a Cloud Function endpoint for manual admin diagnostics.
